OL,3,GNEWSA'Letters to Loved Ones' post box
OL,4,Ascheme launched
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhite post boxes have been introduced
OL,7,Fat cemeteries across Cheshire to give
OL,8,Fpeople a way to stay connected with
OL,9,Floved ones who have died.
OL,11,FThe Letters to Loved Ones scheme
OL,12,Fcollects letters and returns the
OL,13,Fmessages to the cemetery grounds
OL,14,Fthrough composting.
OL,16,FThey would neither be opened nor read
OL,17,Fand would be handled with complete
OL,18,Fconfidentiality, said Cheshire East
OL,19,FCouncil.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
