OL,3,GNEWSA'Letters to Loved Ones' post box
OL,4,Ascheme launched
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Grief is a deeply personal experience
OL,7,Fand we recognise that many people find
OL,8,Fcomfort in continuing their connection
OL,9,Fwith those they have lost," said
OL,10,Fcouncillor David Jefferay.
